WEBVTT

00:08.700 --> 00:15.310
<b>Dareka ga sutete-shimatta
kinou o hiroi-age</b>

00:15.310 --> 00:18.650
<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.650 --> 00:21.950
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:21.950 --> 00:27.390
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo manzoku
suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.590 --> 00:34.530
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro no
sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:36.600
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.600 --> 00:41.840
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka ni
kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.840 --> 00:44.870
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:44.870 --> 00:48.140
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.140 --> 00:51.750
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.750 --> 00:55.410
<b>ima sugu ni</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:08.000
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.000 --> 01:13.240
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no naka
jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.240 --> 01:16.340
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.340 --> 01:19.570
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.570 --> 01:23.150
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.150 --> 01:25.810
<b>ima sugu ni</b>

01:49.000 --> 01:52.000
<b>Is that squad on the move already?</b>

01:57.210 --> 02:02.850
<b>Yes, I've already sent two soldiers
from the Special Forces.</b>

02:02.850 --> 02:04.320
<b>Two men?</b>

02:05.490 --> 02:08.510
<b>With them, two should be enough.</b>

02:09.120 --> 02:10.560
<b>You've got a point.</b>

02:11.460 --> 02:13.690
<b>So, how about the activity
of the demons?</b>

02:14.430 --> 02:18.230
<b>I've received no reports at this time.</b>

02:19.130 --> 02:20.340
<b>Besides...</b>

02:20.340 --> 02:21.800
<b>Besides?</b>

02:22.900 --> 02:26.900
<b>I can't think there are enough
demons to worry about.</b>

02:28.710 --> 02:31.740
<b>Which means, we've got nothing to do?</b>

02:33.250 --> 02:34.720
<b>Not necessarily.</b>

02:40.560 --> 02:42.020
<b>Let's go.</b>

02:44.930 --> 02:47.420
<b>Go? Go where?</b>

02:53.400 --> 02:54.870
<b>To meet them.</b>

03:20.300 --> 03:23.730
<b>But you know, it feels like
it's been a long time</b>

03:23.730 --> 03:25.430
<b>since we've been able
to relax like this.</b>

03:26.130 --> 03:29.590
<b>I guess you have a really
good hand, Gojyo?</b>

03:32.140 --> 03:34.010
<b>But Gojyo's right.</b>

03:34.680 --> 03:39.640
<b>Gods and demons, we kept running
into them one right after another.</b>

03:40.320 --> 03:41.940
<b>Oh, I'll take that for my set.</b>

03:43.850 --> 03:46.790
<b>Hey, Homura's a god, right?</b>

03:46.790 --> 03:50.560
<b>So what's a god doing
coming after us?</b>

03:50.560 --> 03:52.160
<b>Who knows?</b>

03:52.160 --> 03:56.460
<b>He seems a bit different than the one
who descended some time ago.</b>

04:00.840 --> 04:02.300
<b>That's true.</b>

04:03.370 --> 04:06.610
<b>Sanzo, have you heard anything?</b>

04:06.610 --> 04:08.100
<b>Not really.</b>

04:09.140 --> 04:12.150
<b>Besides, regardless of whether
those guys are around or not,</b>

04:12.150 --> 04:15.450
<b>our objective still remains the same.</b>

04:15.450 --> 04:18.250
<b>Just continue westward?</b>

04:18.250 --> 04:19.990
<b>Yeah, that's right.</b>

04:19.990 --> 04:21.690
<b>West?</b>

04:21.690 --> 04:23.780
<b>I wonder what Kougaiji
and the rest are doing?</b>

04:25.390 --> 04:28.760
<b>They wouldn't die if you killed them.</b>

04:28.760 --> 04:30.230
<b>Yeah, but...</b>

04:32.100 --> 04:37.060
<b>There's no use worrying. What will
happen will happen anyway.</b>

04:37.970 --> 04:39.740
<b>Well, that pretty much sums it up.</b>

04:42.610 --> 04:45.340
<b>Careless actions will cost lives.</b>

04:45.910 --> 04:47.380
<b>I win.</b>

05:03.000 --> 05:04.660
<b>What is it, Sanzo? Shopping?</b>

05:05.530 --> 05:07.000
<b>I wanna go too!</b>

05:07.700 --> 05:09.170
<b>Whatever.</b>

05:10.270 --> 05:11.740
<b>I'm not buying any food.</b>

05:16.710 --> 05:19.770
<b>Oh? Where did Sanzo and Goku go?</b>

05:21.620 --> 05:23.170
<b>He said he was out of cigarettes.</b>

05:24.150 --> 05:25.780
<b>Do you think they'll be okay?</b>

05:27.390 --> 05:32.360
<b>He just said careless actions
will cost lives.</b>

05:32.360 --> 05:35.490
<b>He's not a brat running an errand.
Just leave it.</b>

05:36.630 --> 05:38.160
<b>Well, that's true too.</b>

05:39.670 --> 05:42.000
<b>Then how about a game,
since it's been a while?</b>

05:43.040 --> 05:44.510
<b>Sounds good.</b>

05:46.570 --> 05:47.840
<b>Hey, Sanzo.</b>

05:47.840 --> 05:49.680
<b>No.</b>

05:49.680 --> 05:50.950
<b>Come on, Sanzo!</b>

05:50.950 --> 05:52.180
<b>Be quiet.</b>

05:52.180 --> 05:53.150
<b>Sanzo!</b>

05:53.150 --> 05:54.250
<b>Shut up.</b>

05:54.250 --> 05:57.550
<b>What gives?! You've been
ignoring me the whole time!</b>

05:57.550 --> 06:01.610
<b>Then go ahead and say it. I'll kill you
if it's something stupid.</b>

06:02.460 --> 06:04.760
<b>The ramen shop over there...</b>

06:04.760 --> 06:07.500
<b>That's what I call stupid!</b>

06:07.500 --> 06:08.960
<b>Ow...</b>

06:12.130 --> 06:13.730
<b>Genjo Sanzo, right?</b>

06:26.150 --> 06:27.610
<b>Are you all right, Gojyo?</b>

06:30.290 --> 06:31.810
<b>Yeah, just barely.</b>

06:32.790 --> 06:37.250
<b>What excessive people, to suddenly
blow up the entire inn.</b>

06:38.060 --> 06:40.990
<b>Jeez, and I had a good hand too.</b>

06:42.100 --> 06:43.560
<b>There?!</b>

06:46.470 --> 06:47.800
<b>A demon?</b>

06:47.800 --> 06:50.500
<b>No, it seems to be a god.</b>

06:51.210 --> 06:52.940
<b>So, I've got the extras?</b>

06:55.780 --> 06:57.240
<b>What the hell?!</b>

07:09.590 --> 07:12.990
<b>Is this for real?! Are you going to
destroy the town along with us?!</b>

07:12.990 --> 07:14.630
<b>That's right!</b>

07:14.630 --> 07:16.100
<b>Die!</b>

07:19.930 --> 07:24.110
<b>Hey, Hakkai, why do we have to run?</b>

07:24.110 --> 07:26.540
<b>It's useless to get the townspeople
caught in the crossfire.</b>

07:27.180 --> 07:28.640
<b>Besides...</b>

07:29.380 --> 07:31.810
<b>Damn, they're going all out!</b>

07:32.710 --> 07:34.220
<b>Besides, what?</b>

07:34.220 --> 07:36.780
<b>I'm worried about Sanzo and Goku.</b>

07:36.780 --> 07:38.750
<b>What?! What do you mean?!</b>

07:39.750 --> 07:44.890
<b>Well, I'm just worried they
might wreck the town.</b>

07:44.890 --> 07:46.830
<b>I haven't shopped for supplies yet.</b>

07:47.430 --> 07:49.130
<b>I got you.</b>

07:49.130 --> 07:52.760
<b>Please hang on tight,
as I'll be hurrying now!</b>

07:58.170 --> 07:59.470
<b>Is that it?</b>

07:59.470 --> 08:00.940
<b>Is what it?!</b>

08:02.010 --> 08:05.000
<b>This is the Sanzo and company
I've heard so much about?</b>

08:06.510 --> 08:10.790
<b>It seems we overestimated
your abilities.</b>

08:10.790 --> 08:13.450
<b>Well, sorry this is all you get!</b>

08:29.440 --> 08:30.970
<b>Sanzo!</b>

08:30.970 --> 08:33.340
<b>You're one of Homura's minions,
aren't you?</b>

08:36.480 --> 08:39.380
<b>Talk! What is it they're...</b>

08:39.980 --> 08:41.450
<b>What?!</b>

08:52.490 --> 08:53.980
<b>What?!</b>

08:56.730 --> 08:59.390
<b>You bastard! Wasn't he your friend?!</b>

09:00.470 --> 09:05.270
<b>We serve and fight for Lord Homura only.</b>

09:05.270 --> 09:09.330
<b>Anyone who gets in the way of
Lord Homura, even an ally...</b>

09:21.790 --> 09:27.790
<b>Moron, that's what happens when you
forget about us and make speeches.</b>

09:30.000 --> 09:31.470
<b>Are you two unhurt?</b>

09:32.070 --> 09:33.900
<b>Yeah, I'm fine.</b>

09:34.800 --> 09:37.430
<b>So, we have more assassins
coming at us after all.</b>

09:38.170 --> 09:42.130
<b>Jeez, they sure don't get tired
of coming day after day.</b>

09:42.780 --> 09:44.970
<b>Being popular is so tough.</b>

09:46.080 --> 09:49.080
<b>The star performers are yet to come.</b>

09:49.080 --> 09:50.550
<b>What?</b>

09:57.990 --> 09:59.460
<b>Homura!</b>

10:10.570 --> 10:13.540
<b>Are you observing the
Lower World again?</b>

10:14.480 --> 10:18.780
<b>Fool, what else am I
supposed to watch?</b>

10:18.780 --> 10:23.020
<b>It's far more interesting than the
cheap events held up here.</b>

10:23.020 --> 10:26.950
<b>Merciful Goddess, such utterances
are dangerous, so please...</b>

10:28.820 --> 10:30.590
<b>It's starting.</b>

10:30.590 --> 10:32.060
<b>Lady?</b>

10:33.230 --> 10:39.130
<b>Round two between the ragtag bunch
and the twisted outlaws.</b>

10:41.170 --> 10:43.070
<b>Saying such things again...</b>

10:47.540 --> 10:50.010
<b>Now, let's see what happens.</b>

10:53.980 --> 10:55.450
<b>Long time no see.</b>

10:56.250 --> 10:58.050
<b>What are you here for?</b>

10:58.050 --> 11:03.060
<b>We came to watch you guys fight.</b>

11:03.060 --> 11:07.260
<b>Then you got what you came for,
so beat it.</b>

11:07.260 --> 11:08.760
<b>Brilliant!</b>

11:08.760 --> 11:11.500
<b>Is what I'd like to say,
but you're not there yet.</b>

11:11.500 --> 11:13.870
<b>You guys still have the capacity
to grow stronger.</b>

11:14.670 --> 11:17.760
<b>Son Goku, that especially
goes for you.</b>

11:18.610 --> 11:22.310
<b>Leave it to a god to say such
grandiose things.</b>

11:22.310 --> 11:24.850
<b>Bastard, what is it you're getting at?</b>

11:24.850 --> 11:29.420
<b>Don't get me wrong, we only
came to watch today.</b>

11:29.420 --> 11:33.820
<b>Then are you going to just
leave quietly now?</b>

11:33.820 --> 11:35.790
<b>You're not the sort of people</b>

11:35.790 --> 11:38.930
<b>who'd be satisfied with a fight of
this caliber, are you?</b>

11:38.930 --> 11:43.060
<b>You kidding me? That wasn't even
enough to be an appetizer.</b>

11:43.730 --> 11:45.770
<b>I'm relieved to hear that.</b>

11:45.770 --> 11:49.130
<b>This will make it worth the trip.</b>

11:49.700 --> 11:54.200
<b>Then show me this strength
you're talking about!</b>

11:57.650 --> 11:59.110
<b>What?!</b>

12:03.020 --> 12:07.590
<b>Whoops, you'll be fighting us.</b>

12:07.590 --> 12:10.020
<b>It is Homura's insistent wish.</b>

12:10.020 --> 12:12.290
<b>We won't allow you to interfere.</b>

12:13.230 --> 12:16.430
<b>You seem quite confident
of your abilities.</b>

12:16.430 --> 12:18.270
<b>It's three on two, man.</b>

12:18.270 --> 12:22.070
<b>We won't forgive you, even
if you apologize later.</b>

12:22.800 --> 12:24.400
<b>I'm looking forward to it.</b>

12:26.470 --> 12:28.080
<b>Don't let your guard down.</b>

12:28.080 --> 12:31.310
<b>They may be degenerate,
but they're still gods.</b>

12:31.310 --> 12:34.820
<b>That was a pretty needless
thing to say.</b>

12:34.820 --> 12:39.190
<b>We can tell they're nothing ordinary,
just by looking.</b>

12:39.190 --> 12:40.620
<b>Very well, then.</b>

12:41.460 --> 12:42.960
<b>In that case...</b>

12:42.960 --> 12:44.420
<b>Shall we go?</b>

12:48.000 --> 12:49.760
<b>There!</b>

12:49.760 --> 12:51.230
<b>Take that!</b>

12:53.170 --> 12:55.740
<b>What's the matter, Son Goku?</b>

12:55.740 --> 12:58.140
<b>Can you not even touch me?</b>

13:00.580 --> 13:02.480
<b>Come!</b>

13:02.480 --> 13:04.540
<b>Show me your power!</b>

13:05.350 --> 13:06.780
<b>Don't underestimate me!</b>

13:08.780 --> 13:10.840
<b>Grow strong, Son Goku!</b>

13:14.790 --> 13:16.810
<b>There's no opportunity to bring down
my defensive barrier!</b>

13:17.630 --> 13:21.080
<b>At this rate, I'm inevitably going
to end up in a bad fix.</b>

13:22.500 --> 13:24.690
<b>How long are you going
to stay that way?</b>

13:25.270 --> 13:28.790
<b>Maintaining a barrier with
your chi can't be easy.</b>

13:29.440 --> 13:30.900
<b>That's enough!</b>

13:31.710 --> 13:33.170
<b>You sadistic bastard!</b>

13:36.080 --> 13:37.540
<b>Hakkai!</b>

13:44.020 --> 13:46.680
<b>Guess you won't be drinking
for a while now.</b>

13:48.390 --> 13:49.860
<b>Kenren...</b>

14:03.400 --> 14:06.440
<b>I've had enough of your high
and mighty attitude,</b>

14:06.440 --> 14:07.910
<b>you moron!</b>

14:15.720 --> 14:17.550
<b>Fight in earnest.</b>

14:17.550 --> 14:20.210
<b>Do that, and you'll be able
to become even stronger.</b>

14:21.390 --> 14:23.190
<b>This guy's strong!</b>

14:23.190 --> 14:24.690
<b>The guys we've fought so far</b>

14:24.690 --> 14:27.180
<b>were nothing compared
to his speed and power.</b>

14:28.130 --> 14:32.460
<b>What the hell would happen
if he got serious?</b>

14:33.900 --> 14:35.770
<b>Finished already?</b>

14:35.770 --> 14:37.800
<b>Like hell I am!</b>

14:42.580 --> 14:44.610
<b>That was a good strike,</b>

14:44.610 --> 14:46.680
<b>but you're too straightforward.</b>

14:46.680 --> 14:48.680
<b>You can't defeat me like that.</b>

14:48.680 --> 14:52.020
<b>We won't know that unless I try it!</b>

15:02.930 --> 15:05.100
<b>Come at me prepared to die.</b>

15:05.100 --> 15:07.830
<b>You're facing a critical
moment right now.</b>

15:09.270 --> 15:10.740
<b>Why you...</b>

15:15.810 --> 15:18.980
<b>Damn it, he keeps on blasting
away with that thing.</b>

15:18.980 --> 15:21.820
<b>Doesn't that gun ever run out
of bullets or something?</b>

15:21.820 --> 15:23.420
<b>Whining, are we?</b>

15:23.420 --> 15:26.910
<b>Are you kidding? I'm just pissed
because they're playing with us.</b>

15:28.260 --> 15:33.060
<b>Point. I won't be happy until we give
them a good beating either.</b>

15:33.060 --> 15:36.900
<b>And we can't just leave
Goku on his own too.</b>

15:36.900 --> 15:42.740
<b>What a rare event. We're all
in agreement for once.</b>

15:42.740 --> 15:44.600
<b>All right, let's go!</b>

16:04.460 --> 16:06.690
<b>We're gonna be in real danger
at this rate.</b>

16:11.100 --> 16:12.570
<b>Everyone...</b>

16:24.680 --> 16:26.150
<b>What should I do?</b>

16:26.910 --> 16:28.480
<b>Aren't you going to take it off?</b>

16:28.480 --> 16:29.950
<b>What?!</b>

16:33.590 --> 16:37.520
<b>You can take the demon power
limiter off, you know?</b>

16:38.460 --> 16:39.950
<b>I'm not taking it off!</b>

16:42.200 --> 16:45.260
<b>I'd rather die than take it off
just to fight you!</b>

16:49.470 --> 16:51.770
<b>Then, come, Son Goku!</b>

16:53.610 --> 16:55.600
<b>I'm going to beat you up
for sure this time!</b>

16:56.340 --> 16:58.470
<b>Or else, I'm not going to last!</b>

17:04.050 --> 17:05.540
<b>No...</b>

17:11.590 --> 17:13.060
<b>Stronger...</b>

17:14.330 --> 17:16.760
<b>Grow even stronger, Son Goku.</b>

17:24.940 --> 17:26.410
<b>Goku!</b>

17:52.170 --> 17:54.900
<b>Zenon, Shien, we're leaving.</b>

17:54.900 --> 17:56.370
<b>Hey!</b>

17:58.540 --> 18:00.400
<b>Man, fine.</b>

18:01.080 --> 18:04.480
<b>This is what you wanted then, Homura?</b>

18:06.080 --> 18:08.570
<b>Wait! You gonna leave things
unfinished again?!</b>

18:09.180 --> 18:11.520
<b>Quit toying with us and
get serious already!</b>

18:13.820 --> 18:16.150
<b>I've already fulfilled my objective.</b>

18:16.790 --> 18:18.490
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

18:18.490 --> 18:20.760
<b>Weren't you guys after the Scripture?!</b>

18:22.360 --> 18:24.830
<b>If I took the Scripture now,</b>

18:24.830 --> 18:27.390
<b>I'd have no more excuse
to come see you guys.</b>

18:31.310 --> 18:33.170
<b>Isn't that right, Konzen?</b>

18:35.610 --> 18:41.450
<b>Homura, do you think you're
fettering them by doing so?</b>

18:42.780 --> 18:44.650
<b>Just like those chains on your wrists?</b>

18:47.720 --> 18:51.680
<b>Jeez, it isn't easy putting up
with his whims.</b>

18:55.060 --> 18:56.530
<b>See you later.</b>

19:06.740 --> 19:09.340
<b>Goku, are you all right?!</b>

19:09.340 --> 19:10.810
<b>Goku!</b>

19:22.920 --> 19:24.390
<b>Are you awake?</b>

19:26.230 --> 19:27.930
<b>Ow!</b>

19:27.930 --> 19:31.160
<b>It'd be for your own good
to rest today.</b>

19:31.970 --> 19:33.430
<b>You should avoid pushing yourself.</b>

19:35.840 --> 19:37.300
<b>Oh, right.</b>

19:38.040 --> 19:40.230
<b>I lost...</b>

19:41.010 --> 19:44.980
<b>Yeah, more like he whipped you,</b>

19:44.980 --> 19:46.650
<b>you loser monkey.</b>

19:46.650 --> 19:49.580
<b>What the hell?! Don't call me
a monkey!</b>

19:49.580 --> 19:52.790
<b>A monkey's a monkey, you weak-ass
beat-up monkey.</b>

19:52.790 --> 19:57.160
<b>Grrr! As if you're in any
position to talk!</b>

19:57.160 --> 19:58.490
<b>What'd you say?!</b>

19:58.490 --> 19:59.960
<b>He's right.</b>

20:00.690 --> 20:02.990
<b>We aren't so different from Goku.</b>

20:04.270 --> 20:06.830
<b>We were completely at their mercy.</b>

20:09.970 --> 20:11.440
<b>I've decided.</b>

20:12.810 --> 20:16.140
<b>He's definitely really strong,
but I've decided.</b>

20:17.140 --> 20:19.310
<b>I'm going to beat him up the next time
I see him, no matter what!</b>

20:22.280 --> 20:24.910
<b>Then you better get your energy up
while you've got the chance.</b>

20:25.650 --> 20:31.060
<b>Come to think of it, I just saw a very
luxurious Chinese restaurant.</b>

20:31.060 --> 20:34.430
<b>What?! Now that you mention it,
I'm starting to get really hungry!</b>

20:34.430 --> 20:35.900
<b>Don't get cocky!</b>

20:45.810 --> 20:54.610
<b>Yukikau hito wa mina
omoi nimotsu seotte</b>

20:55.980 --> 21:06.420
<b>Touku ni yureru kagerou no naka ni
ashita o mitsukeru</b>

21:07.760 --> 21:17.860
<b>Kono te o kobore-ochiru
suna no you na kanjou</b>

21:19.210 --> 21:32.190
<b>Ano toki mune ni sasatta
kotoba ga fui ni uzuku kedo</b>

21:32.190 --> 21:43.630
<b>Hatenai yoru o kazoenagara
jibun no kakera sagashite ita</b>

21:43.630 --> 21:54.910
<b>Ushinau hodo ni kono omoi ga
tashika ni natteku</b>

21:54.910 --> 22:07.080
<b>ima nara kitto aruite yukeru
doko made mo</b>
